    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a light path assistance type Gu that narration calls very famous, and a batch of them is shown lighting a dark cave.",
        "chapters": [
          563
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path-type-named",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "This wiki has no light-path page yet, so the label stays as novel prose here.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path-type-named",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is oddly shaped like a pentagram, only half as large as a fingernail.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After refinement it sits in the right palm as a five-sided star. When it takes essence it emits a milky white glow.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A dead copy is a milky-white five star-shaped body that dissipates into the air.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is oddly shaped like a pentagram, about half a fingernail in size.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After refinement it sits in Fang Yuan’s right palm as a five-sided star mark beside the Moonlight Gu’s blue crescent. When both take essence, Little Light Gu shines milky white and that light fuses into the moonlight.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "On a failed fusion the dead Little Light Gu is shown as a milky-white five star-shaped body that dissipates into the air.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a common assistance-type Gu for Moonlight Gu, an average pick that still fits Fang Yuan’s early attack path.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Alone it is support for Moonlight Gu. With both Gu in the same palm taking essence, the moonblade roughly doubles in size and doubles in attack range compared with Moonlight Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "One Little Light Gu raises moonblade power by 100%. Holding two does not stack that boost additively: two still give the same 100% raise.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the academy year-end arena, watchers treat that reinforcement as real: Yao Hong says even the moonblade cannot pierce Fang Zheng’s barrier, and Gu Yue Qing Shu adds that even a Little Light Gu boosted moonblade only spends Fang Zheng’s jade barrier essence faster.",
        "chapters": [
          85
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_hong",
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
